        "data": "{\"key\":\"initial_standard_a\",\"data\":{\"subject\":\"Thanks for your enquiry, ##name## — {{1.data.company_name}}\",\"body_html\":\"<p>Hi ##name##,</p>##ai_opening##<p>Thank you for getting in touch about ##topic##. We've received your enquiry and are excited to learn more about what you have in mind.</p><p>We work with a wide range of clients across events, film, and media production, and we'd love to explore how we can help bring your vision to life.</p><p>One of our team will review your details and get back to you shortly. In the meantime, feel free to reply to this email if there's anything else you'd like to share — we'd love to hear more.</p>##signature##\",\"active\":\"true\",\"updated_at\":\"{{formatDate(now; \\\"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ssZ\\\")}}\"}}"
