        "data": "{\"key\":\"step_3_a\",\"data\":{\"subject\":\"One last check-in — ##topic## | {{1.data.company_name}}\",\"body_html\":\"<p>Hi ##name##,</p>##ai_opening##<p>We're checking in one last time regarding your enquiry about ##topic##. We completely understand if now isn't the right time — plans change, and there's absolutely no pressure.</p><p>If you are still interested, we'd be happy to pick up where we left off. And if your needs have changed, that's fine too — just let us know and we'll update our records.</p><p>Either way, it was great to hear from you, and we're always here if you need us in the future.</p>##signature##\",\"active\":\"true\",\"updated_at\":\"{{formatDate(now; \\\"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ssZ\\\")}}\"}}"
