        "data": "{\"key\":\"initial_high_b\",\"data\":{\"subject\":\"Thanks for your enquiry, ##name## — {{1.data.company_name}}\",\"body_html\":\"<p>Hi ##name##,</p>##ai_opening##<p>Thank you so much for reaching out about ##topic##. This sounds like a brilliant project and exactly the kind of work we love getting involved in.</p><p>We've had a look at your enquiry and we're keen to chat through the details with you as soon as possible. Would you be free for a quick call this week? Just reply with a time that works and we'll make it happen.</p><p>In the meantime, feel free to take a look at some of our recent work — we think you'll get a great sense of what we can do together.</p>##signature##\",\"active\":\"true\",\"updated_at\":\"{{formatDate(now; \\\"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ssZ\\\")}}\"}}"
